ong study", "bbox": {"x": 955.3497470751914, "y": 1778.3366367027722, "width": 593.1987501356336, "height": 38.684172481298525}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "fourth trial reported higher seropositivity rates and antibody liters in PLHIV on ART than not on ARTS 53 while", "bbox": {"x": 326.2055554261345, "y": 1814.5312499843546, "width": 597.2777777777778, "height": 55.12500000000005}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "participants HPV negative at baseline (N.-7) or with unknown baseline HPV status (N.-3). (Supplement", "bbox": {"x": 955.316047429037, "y": 1811.2022837196243, "width": 593.4046855078803, "height": 65.11186847090714}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "another one reported higher antibody titers for all four", "bbox": {"x": 326.20555544976247, "y": 1874.2499999788447, "width": 592.6833333333334, "height": 32.15625000000013}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Table S6; additional details in S7). No results were avail-", "bbox": {"x": 955.644444216531, "y": 1874.2499999891488, "width": 588.088888888889, "height": 27.5624999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "HPV vaccine types among PLHIV virally suppressed", "bbox": {"x": 330.79999977027785, "y": 1906.4062499892334, "width": 588.0888888888888, "height": 27.5624999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "able for children. No results by HIV disease stage or", "bbox": {"x": 955.3515595931174, "y": 1899.9185910797726, "width": 593.1944736904569, "height": 37.32126161456116}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "compared to non-suppressedi", "bbox": {"x": 325.91507604185836, "y": 1933.3126636675822, "width": 336.1686913384332, "height": 36.45493812113995}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ART status were available. Estimates of biological outcomes were generally deemed of low quality following", "bbox": {"x": 955.276249650684, "y": 1929.7651136257036, "width": 593.3398728264702, "height": 66.71751415729521}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Biological endpoints", "bbox": {"x": 326.20555532583336, "y": 1998.2812499765625, "width": 225.1277777777778, "height": 22.968750000000163}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Results on various biological outcomes among PLHIV following vaccination were available from two RCTS", "bbox": {"x": 326.20555538464964, "y": 2025.8437499838124, "width": 592.6833333333333, "height": 59.71874999999979}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "our study quality assessment. Main study limitations included failure to specify the HPV vaccine type present in abnormal cytology samples, define baseline HPV", "bbox": {"x": 955.6444441443577, "y": 1998.2812499838212, "width": 592.6833333333333, "height": 87.28125000000018}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "www.thelancet.com Vol 52 October, 2022", "bbox": {"x": 1185.3666664369443, "y": 2149.8749999854626, "width": 362.9611111111111, "height": 22.96874999999992}}], "ms": 533.303209}